* PT1000_1 front end (R91, R70, R89, R90, U11 INA333 with Rg = R92)
.param rpt=1000
Vref ref 0 2.048
R91 ref p 4994.99
Rpt p m {rpt}
R70 m 0 4994.99
R89 ref n 4994.99
R90 n m 825.8249999999999
* INA333 as an ideal difference amplifier, output limited to the 0-3.3 V rails
Bina out 0 V = max(0, min(3.3, 30.040726715145322 * (v(p) - v(n))))
Rload out 0 100k
.control
foreach val 1097.347 1308.968 1385.055
  alterparam rpt = $val
  reset
  op
  print v(out)
end
.endc
.end
